{"suttaId":"tha-ap435","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[618,644],"vripara":"26"},"segments":{"tha-ap435:0.3":"Pāṭihīrasaññakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap435:1.1":"“Padumuttaro nāma jino, āhutīnaṃ paṭiggaho;","tha-ap435:1.3":"Vasīsatasahassehi, nagaraṃ pāvisī tadā.","tha-ap435:2.1":"“Nagaraṃ pavisantassa, upasantassa tādino;","tha-ap435:2.3":"Ratanāni pajjotiṃsu [panādiṃsu (pī.)], nigghoso āsi tāvade.","tha-ap435:3.1":"“Buddhassa ānubhāvena, bherī vajjumaghaṭṭitā;","tha-ap435:3.3":"Sayaṃ vīṇā pavajjanti, buddhassa pavisato puraṃ.","tha-ap435:4.1":"“Buddhaseṭṭhaṃ namassāmi [na passāmi (sī.)], padumuttaramahāmuniṃ;","tha-ap435:4.3":"Pāṭihīrañca passitvā, tattha cittaṃ pasādayiṃ.","tha-ap435:5.1":"“Aho buddho aho dhammo, aho no satthusampadā;","tha-ap435:5.3":"Acetanāpi turiyā, sayameva pavajjare.","tha-ap435:6.1":"“Satasahassito kappe, yaṃ saññamalabhiṃ tadā;","tha-ap435:6.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhasaññāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap435:7.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap435:8.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap435:9.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap435:10.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā pāṭihīrasaññako thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap435:11.1":"Pāṭihīrasaññakattherassāpadānaṃ tatiyaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
